{"4920930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "赫斯提的餐桌", "steam_appid": 4920930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Table of Hesti&quot; is a simulation management game with themes of restaurants and farms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting, animal husbandry, fishing, to cooking, you will learn everything about food and drink from scratch, gradually understanding the people and life on this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Planting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilize, weed, and water your fields to enable crops to grow better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Animal husbandry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens, ducks, cows, sheep, or any other common animals can all be raised on a ranch! Take care of them by feeding them carefully and collecting the by-products they produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume fishing vouchers and randomly obtain seafood in the fishing ground! What will you catch next time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Cooking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's try making dishes using the ingredients we've obtained through our business operations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over twenty distinct flavor schools and culinary techniques, accompanied by thousands of recipes, will expedite your journey towards becoming a top-tier Hesti chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy the ordering needs of customers and strive to improve the restaurant's rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate the operations of various areas in Hesti and manage this grand hotel together with the staff.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Table of Hesti&quot; is a simulation management game with themes of restaurants and farms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting, animal husbandry, fishing, to cooking, you will learn everything about food and drink from scratch, gradually understanding the people and life on this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Planting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilize, weed, and water your fields to enable crops to grow better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Animal husbandry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens, ducks, cows, sheep, or any other common animals can all be raised on a ranch! Take care of them by feeding them carefully and collecting the by-products they produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume fishing vouchers and randomly obtain seafood in the fishing ground! What will you catch next time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Cooking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's try making dishes using the ingredients we've obtained through our business operations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over twenty distinct flavor schools and culinary techniques, accompanied by thousands of recipes, will expedite your journey towards becoming a top-tier Hesti chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Restaurant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfy the ordering needs of customers and strive to improve the restaurant's rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▲ Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate the operations of various areas in Hesti and manage this grand hotel together with the staff.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Table of Hesti&quot; is a simulation management game with themes of restaurants and farms. From planting, animal husbandry, fishing, to cooking, you will learn everything about food and drink from scratch, gradually understanding the people and life on this land.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4920930/bc7adefbb2f29c445d4bcb6143e3ed5fb0eebca5/header.jpg?t=1787594954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4920930/f67216dc48d67431cea